WEBVTT

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.070
<i>Mommy!</i>

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.420
<i>I'm sorry I'm late.</i>

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.650
<i>Mommy? There's blood...</i>

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>I'm fine, Akari.</i>

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.000
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.260
Where am I?

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.740
Good morning.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.740
You're...

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.230
My name is Etia Visconti.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.290
How are you feeling?

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.390
What happened?

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:11.670
What about the fire? Is everyone okay?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.300
Everyone from the mansion is fine.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.650
Their injuries were minor and they're 
being treated at the hospital.

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:19.180
I see.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.250
I'm sure you were rather surprised
 with all this happening so suddenly.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.790
But I'm glad I saw you again.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:28.190
Welcome to Sefiro Fiore.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.070
Sephiro? Huh?

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.810
<b>The Blood-Soaked Future</b>

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.420
After the fire, I brought you here.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.840
Both to protect you, and 
to ask something of you.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:16.710
Ask something?

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.180
We shall talk about that eventually.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:24.200
By the way, do you remember the 
monster you saw at the fire?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.220
Monster?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.590
It wasn't an illusion.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.730
Then I, um...

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.360
Indeed. You fought it.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.240
That monster is called a Daemonia.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.400
This is Ariel.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.830
She is my deputy director.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:53.590
Envy, betrayal, 
grudges, deceit...

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:58.000
Daemonia are evil spirits that like 
evil hearts and attack people.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:01.630
Those evil spirits offer to grant 
people's wishes, and in return,

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.880
establish a contract with the person.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.600
However, after the wish is granted,

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:12.100
they cause the humans to 
slaughter each other.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:19.610
Many wars and battles throughout 
history have involved Daemonia.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.230
But...

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:27.990
This organization, Sefiro Fiore, is a 
battle unit created to destroy the Daemonia.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:33.010
As a cover, we exist 
as a fortune-telling school,

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.090
but we coordinate with various branches

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.270
around the world in an
 effort to annihilate them.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:43.310
Our organization has 21 
members who are able to use

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.220
the powers of the Elemental Tarot.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.720
Elemental Tarot?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.220
It's the power you used to defeat 
the Daemonia back at the mansion.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:57.550
Each of the 21 members possesses 
the powers of a different Tarot card.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:01.260
Without these powers, there is 
no way to defeat the Daemonia.

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:05.310
You were the last one 
we were looking for,

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:06.740
the user of The Sun card.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.120
Me?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.360
We need your help.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.750
But I... This is so sudden.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.160
Your mother fought, too.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.300
My mom? Did you know Taiyo Hinata?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.770
Did my mom have these powers, too?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.770
Your mother always said,

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:41.270
if we don't fight, who will be able 
to stop these unfortunate events?

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.470
Fight...

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.030
Could I actually do it?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.730
You're Hinata's daughter, aren't you?

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.340
Oh, that's right!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:19.310
I know it's somewhere... Here!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.030
Huh? What's that?

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:34.820
Akari, your ride's here!

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.330
Coming!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.210
All right, I'll be off, then.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.460
I just remembered...

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:45.840
When Hinata was about your age,

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:50.090
she left the house to go to a school 
that specialized in fortune-telling.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:55.210
I'll do my best! Just like Mom!

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.730
I'm Taiyo Akari.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.830
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.490
I'm going to announce the teams.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:19.540
Meltina, Priscilla, and the Tendo 
sisters will carry on as usual.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.570
I'll have Akari join your team.

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:27.300
Since you're all newcomers, make 
sure to help each other out.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:27.920
Got it?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.170
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.180
So the position's been filled.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.510
The Sun card user.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:41.270
It took a while, but now she 
won't die in vain, meow.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.560
But, she'll still need to be monitored.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.660
Understood.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:52.070
So that Akari girl ended up joining 
the organization after all.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.570
Well, I guess it's not like 
she could have refused.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.330
She looked... cool.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.330
A-Akari-san, when she was fighting.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.210
Oh, well, I guess.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.960
I wonder if we can 
be friends with her?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.210
Yeah, it'd be nice if 
we could have some fun.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.340
There's no need to be 
friendly with her.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.220
Well, yeah, this isn't 
exactly play time.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.990
I guess we'll just have to 
talk to her and find out.

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:28.940
There we go.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:49.400
<i>The same powers as Mom...</i>

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.930
E-Excuse me, it's me, 
Tsukuyomi Luna.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:08.110
I thought it might be nice 
to have dinner together.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:10.940
Akari-san?

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.080
What's this?

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:28.960
<i>No, Akari.</i>

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.590
<i>Eh?</i>

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.340
<i>You promised not to touch.</i>

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.340
<i>O-Okay.</i>

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:38.540
<i>Mom... Why?</i>

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.350
Huh?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.990
G-Good morning!

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:55.080
I see, so you came to get me.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:59.310
And yet, I fell asleep with you.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.220
It's all right. Thanks, Tsukuyomi-san.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.370
You can call me Luna.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.970
Oh, okay. Luna-chan...

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.630
Anyway, this is quite the plant.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.340
It grows super fast 
when it's in my room.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.460
I'm not sure why, though.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.400
It's probably your Tarot powers.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:24.570
Card users apparently use their 
powers without even realizing it.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:29.140
So I'm guessing they all grew because 
of the powers from The Sun.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.800
What kind of powers do 
you have, Luna-chan?

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.250
My card is The Moon,

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.150
so dogs come up to me and 
it's not really useful.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.030
I see. So there are all kinds of powers.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:46.220
It'll be difficult when you 
first enter the organization,

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.290
but I'll be happy to help.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.160
Thank you.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.300
Ginka, takoyaki again?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.910
And you're eating chicken 
salad again, right, Seira?

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.140
It's the best thing to 
eat to gain muscle,

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.140
and everything is the same 
once it's in your stomach.

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.890
That'd be the same for 
takoyaki, wouldn't it?

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.890
You won't get proper nutrition.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.060
That's not true.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.930
Octopus is high in protein 
and low in calories.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.600
We already started eating.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:22.410
Sorry I'm late. Um...

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.910
Nice to meet you again.
I'm Taiyo Akari.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:29.910
I'm Shirokane Ginka and 
this is Hoshikawa Seira.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.170
A pleasure.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:38.290
Wow, so you didn't know anything 
about this organization, Akari?

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.930
Yeah. I heard my mom 
used to go here,

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:44.930
but she passed away two years ago.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.470
Oh, it's fine now!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:54.440
I was taught the powers of the 
Tarot starting since I was little.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:55.940
Me, too.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.070
So you, too, Hoshikawa-san?

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:02.030
Seira is fine. I was 
told when I was five

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.320
that I would awaken when 
I turned thirteen.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:09.860
I see. I wonder why my 
mom didn't tell me.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.920
It's pretty dangerous 
fighting Daemonia,

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.460
so maybe she was just trying to protect you?

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:18.900
But I need to do my best and fight.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.970
People being attacked is just awful.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:25.470
Well, yeah...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.180
<i>Mom, please protect me.</i>

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:44.230
Takase boats are little 
boats that go up and down

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.700
the Takase river in Kyoto.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.840
And when criminals were exiled to

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.620
a remote island during 
the Tokugawa era...

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.060
Hydrogen burns like so.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.680
All right, put your heart into it!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.390
It's pretty much like a normal school.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:20.270
I thought there'd be more classes 
on the Tarot and more training.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:24.280
Well, the motto here is, "Learn 
everything you need to know in battle."

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.280
Otherwise, the classes are normal,

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.030
so we'll be okay going 
out into the real world.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:34.370
Well, our teachers are pretty much just 
Etia-san, Meltina-san and the others,

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.390
so it's more like cram school 
rather than regular school.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:42.820
It's not like we'd go out into the 
real world from the organization.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.800
So it's a waste.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.470
Wh-What is that?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.390
It's a mission.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.060
Don't weigh us down.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.610
O-Okay.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.600
Coordinates locked. The 
Astralux is normal.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.180
Convertillento posidio.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:45.320
Tenebrae Mode! Wheel 
of Fortune, start!

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:00.630
Do your best, Onee-tans!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.300
The Star, come.

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.690
I'm counting on you, Temperance.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.200
Please, The Moon.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.180
<i>This is the power of The Sun...</i>

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:49.780
How do you like...

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:55.200
...this?!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:08.600
Finish it in one strike! I'll cover you.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:20.370
No...

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:30.070
Fuyuna?

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.070
Akari-san!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.570
What's wrong?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.720
That's not good!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:49.920
Akari-san!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.960
I'll take care of it. 
Get her out of here.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:12.110
We altered your memories.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.030
Why?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.070
Daemonia are evil spirits that 
creep into the crevices

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.560
of the human heart, and 
then take over the soul.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:24.860
When you first awakened,

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.360
you were almost taken 
over by a Daemonia

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.800
from the shock of killing your cousin.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:31.630
We wanted to prevent that from happening.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.630
Why do you do such cruel things?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:43.350
This means I pretty much 
killed Fuyuna twice!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.350
You should have just left me alone!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:51.220
It would have been better if 
the Daemonia took me over.

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.570
I cannot allow that.

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.850
You are the successor to The Sun card.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:19:01.740
If you were to be taken over, 
we'd have to kill you.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.500
Then you should have just killed me.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:29.260
If you scrub that hard, it's 
going to damage your skin.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.870
It never gets easier, no 
matter how many times...

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.650
Well, yeah.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:44.160
There is no way to turn a person back 
after they've become a Daemonia.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:49.270
Meaning, if we don't kill the person, 
we can't kill the Daemonia.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.440
The history of the person
 who became a Daemonia

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.390
disappears, along with memories 
of anyone that knew that person.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:01.700
You will probably never have 
to answer for anyone's death.

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:05.550
<i>Mom, I...</i>

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:07.430
Akari?

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.330
Wait a second, Akari!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.760
Did you run away from school?

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:24.390
But you're the one who 
said you wanted to go.

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.660
You said they'd have what you 
need for fortune-telling

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.400
and that it'd be a great environment.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:30.950
Auntie...

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:34.540
Fuyuna...

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:39.210
Fuyuna-san? Is that a 
new friend of yours?

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:48.830
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! 
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:52.390
If it's that hard, you 
can quit at any time.

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.260
She passes, meow.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:10.240
Indeed. Since she is stable even 
after regaining her memories,

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.370
we can probably expect 
great things from her.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.750
What?

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:18.000
Just what do you think 
people's feelings are?!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:18.940
Etia.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:26.220
That's right. That's how it should be.

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:36.510
<i>I have nowhere to go now.</i>

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.060
Terrible...

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:48.530
Dad, hurry, hurry!

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.800
<i>At this rate... But...</i>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:30.820
<b>The Fool never has any prejudices and 
always looks at the unknown with fresh eyes,
 always challenging themselves to something new.</b>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:41.390
<b>#00       The Fool</b>

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:28.770
We're the Tendo sisters!

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:30.190
We're going to play shiritori!

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:32.780
Um... Tendo (Tendou)... 
So, rabbit (usagi)?

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:34.370
<b>At times, they'll rush too far in or go
 in the wrong direction, but since they 
have no fear and have unique abilities, 
they are able to accomplish great feats.</b>

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:33.620
Dragonfly (ginyanma).

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:34.310
Window (mado).

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:34.960
Door knob (doa nobu).

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:38.700
<b>If you were to choose this card, 
relying on your positive attitude and 
intuition to make decisions as well as 
taking actions that require you to look 
for change should lead to success.</b>

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:36.390
A-Armor (bugu).

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:37.580
T-The Fool (gusha)!

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:38.390
Oh!

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:41.350
<b> Voices of Condolence</b>

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.620
See you next time!

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>However, if the card is reversed, you 
can make situations worse by not being 
able to think calmly</b>

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.350
<b>or having a pessimistic attitude. 
There is also the possibility you will lose 
faith in yourself.</b>
